    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-List Ecommerce Cart Summarys-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Summary Retrieval API provides a comprehensive overview of the shopping cart contents for users. It allows clients to fetch detailed summaries of items currently in the shopping cart, including product details, quantities, and total costs. This API is typically utilized by frontend applications and mobile apps to display cart information to users in real-time. By leveraging this endpoint, businesses can enhance the customer experience by ensuring users are informed about their selected products before checkout.",
